<LanguageData>
  <!--EN: A foreboding shadow has been cast over the land; there is an ominous presence in the dark shadow of these clouds that curses the living.-->
  <DarkClouds.description>地上有不祥的阴影，在这些云的阴影中有不祥的东西，诅咒着活人。</DarkClouds.description>
  <!--EN: The dark clouds are dispersing.-->
  <DarkClouds.endMessage>乌云正在消散。</DarkClouds.endMessage>
  <!--EN: dark clouds-->
  <DarkClouds.label>乌云</DarkClouds.label>
  <!--EN: A foreboding shadow has been cast over the land; there is an ominous presence in the dark shadow of these clouds that curses the living.-->
  <DarkClouds.letterText>地上有不祥的阴影，在这些云的阴影中有不祥的东西，诅咒着活人。</DarkClouds.letterText>
  <!--EN: There is a malicious energy hidden within these dark clouds.-->
  <DarkThunderstorm.description>在这些乌云中隐藏着一种邪恶的能量。</DarkThunderstorm.description>
  <!--EN: The violent thunderstorm is receding.-->
  <DarkThunderstorm.endMessage>邪之风暴正在减弱。</DarkThunderstorm.endMessage>
  <!--EN: Violent Storm-->
  <DarkThunderstorm.label>邪之风暴</DarkThunderstorm.label>
  <!--EN: The end is nigh - rampaging demons are attacking your colony!\nLike a herald to impending doom, fire and ash have begun falling from the skies.\n\nThese infernal beings have an assortment of attacks and challenging tactics.\nHowever, demons are unable to remain in this realm for extended periods and will be force to return to their hellish plane in about 3 hours. Defeat or outlast this nightmare.\nThere is very little time to prepare.\n\nGood luck!-->
  <DemonAssault.description>一切都会终结!-一个狂暴的恶魔正在攻击你的殖民地！\n\n这个地狱生物有各种各样的攻击方式，而且他会使用充满挑战性的战术。\n火焰和灰烬将从天而降。\n但是，恶魔无法在这个殖民地中停留很长时间，将会被迫在大约3小时内返回他们的世界。击败他或熬过这场噩梦。\n没有多少时间准备了。\n\n祝你好运！</DemonAssault.description>
  <!--EN: The demons have returned to their infernal plane.-->
  <DemonAssault.endMessage>恶魔正在前往另一个地方。</DemonAssault.endMessage>
  <!--EN: demon attack-->
  <DemonAssault.label>狂暴的恶魔</DemonAssault.label>
  <!--EN: demon attack-->
  <DemonAssault.label>狂暴的恶魔</DemonAssault.label>
  <!--EN: Demon attack-->
  <DemonAssault.letterLabel>狂暴的恶魔</DemonAssault.letterLabel>
