  <!--EN: The planet's celestial alignment is causing an ebb in mana.  All creatures attuned with magical powers will slowly lose power.-->
  <ManaDrain.description>行星的异变导致了魔法能量的逐渐衰落。所有与魔法力量协调的生物会缓慢地失去力量。</ManaDrain.description>
  <!--EN: Magic is returning to normal.-->
  <ManaDrain.endMessage>魔力回复到了正常状态。</ManaDrain.endMessage>
  <!--EN: mana drain-->
  <ManaDrain.label>法力流失</ManaDrain.label>
  <!--EN: mana drain-->
  <ManaDrain.label>法力流失</ManaDrain.label>
  <!--EN: Mana drain-->
  <ManaDrain.letterLabel>法力流失</ManaDrain.letterLabel>
  <!--EN: The planet's celestial alignment is shifting, causing an ebb in mana.\n\nAll creatures attuned with magical powers will slowly lose mana and will become physically ill if they have no mana remaining.-->
  <ManaDrain.letterText>行星的异变导致了魔法能量的逐渐衰落。所有与魔法力量协调的生物会缓慢地失去力量。</ManaDrain.letterText>
  <!--EN: The planet's celestial alignment is shifting, causing an ebb in mana.\n\nAll creatures attuned with magical powers will slowly lose mana.\n\nCreatures may become physically ill if they have no mana remaining.-->
  <ManaDrain.letterText>行星的异变导致了魔法能量的逐渐衰落。所有与魔法力量协调的生物会缓慢地失去力量。</ManaDrain.letterText>
  <!--EN: The planet's celestial alignment is causing a surge in mana.  All creatures attuned with magical powers will gain mana at an increased rate.-->
  <ManaSurge.description>行星的异变导致了魔力变得汹涌澎湃。所有与魔法力量协调的生物，法力会得到一定量的增长。</ManaSurge.description>
  <!--EN: Magic is returning to normal.-->
  <ManaSurge.endMessage>魔力回复到了正常状态。</ManaSurge.endMessage>
  <!--EN: mana surge-->
  <ManaSurge.label>法力涌动</ManaSurge.label>
  <!--EN: mana surge-->
  <ManaSurge.label>法力涌动</ManaSurge.label>
  <!--EN: Mana surge-->
  <ManaSurge.letterLabel>法力涌动</ManaSurge.letterLabel>
  <!--EN: The planet's celestial alignment has shifted, causing a surge in mana.  All creatures attuned with magical powers will gain mana at an increased rate.-->
  <ManaSurge.letterText>行星的异变导致了魔力变得汹涌澎湃。所有与魔法力量协调的生物，法力会得到一定量的增长。</ManaSurge.letterText>
  <!--EN: The planet's celestial alignment has shifted, causing a surge in mana.  All creatures attuned with magical powers will gain mana at an increased rate.-->
  <ManaSurge.letterText>行星的异变导致了魔力变得汹涌澎湃。所有与魔法力量协调的生物，法力会得到一定量的增长。</ManaSurge.letterText>
  <!--EN: Chaotic forces are causing a dangerous mana storm. During a mana storm, attempts to use mana to realize magical intent external to the caster will harm the caster proportionally to the mana cost of the spell. This damage is applied before the spell incantation begins. Unformed used of mana and internal use of magic, such as the transfer of mana or dispelling an enchantment, remains unaffected. Magic circles or foci cannot be used during this event. While the mana storm is active, energy costs are halved and mana reduction limit is removed..-->
  <TM_ManaStorm.description>混乱的力量正在造成危险的法力风暴。\n\n在法力风暴期间，任何试图使用法力的行为将对施法者造成与法术法力消耗成正比的伤害。这施法前便会造成伤害。未成形魔法的使用和魔法的内部使用，如闪烁魔法或驱散附魔，不受影响。法力风暴时不能使用魔术阵或魔法中心。当法力风暴来临时，所有的能量消耗减半，法力的上限减少将会被移除。</TM_ManaStorm.description>
  <!--EN: Magic is returning to normal.-->
  <TM_ManaStorm.endMessage>魔法正在回归原样</TM_ManaStorm.endMessage>
  <!--EN: mana storm-->
  <TM_ManaStorm.label>法力风暴</TM_ManaStorm.label>
  <!--EN: mana storm-->
  <TM_ManaStorm.label>法力风暴</TM_ManaStorm.label>
  <!--EN: Mana storm-->
  <TM_ManaStorm.letterLabel>法力风暴</TM_ManaStorm.letterLabel>
  <!--EN: Chaotic forces are causing a dangerous tide of mana.\n\nDuring a mana storm, attempts to use mana to realize magical intent external to the caster will harm the caster proportionally to the mana cost of the spell. This damage is applied before the spell incantation begins. Unformed used of mana and internal use of magic, such as the transfer of mana or dispelling an enchantment, remains unaffected. Magic circles or foci cannot be used during this event. While the mana storm is active, energy costs are halved and mana reduction limit is removed..-->
  <TM_ManaStorm.letterText>混乱的力量正在造成危险的法力风暴。\n\n在法力风暴期间，任何试图使用法力的行为将对施法者造成与法术法力消耗成正比的伤害。这施法前便会造成伤害。未成形魔法的使用和魔法的内部使用，如闪烁魔法或驱散附魔，不受影响。法力风暴时不能使用魔术阵或魔法中心。当法力风暴来临时，所有的能量消耗减半，法力的上限减少将会被移除。</TM_ManaStorm.letterText>
  <!--EN: Chaotic forces are causing a dangerous mana tides.\n\nDuring a mana storm, attempts to use mana to realize magical intent external to the caster will harm the caster proportionally to the mana cost of the spell. This damage is applied before the spell incantation begins. Unformed use of mana and internal use of magic, such as the transfer of mana or dispelling an enchantment is unaffected. Magic circles or foci cannot be used during this event. While the mana storm is active, energy costs are halved and mana reduction limit is removed.-->
  <TM_ManaStorm.letterText>混乱的力量正在造成危险的法力风暴。\n\n在法力风暴期间，任何试图使用法力的行为将对施法者造成与法术法力消耗成正比的伤害。这施法前便会造成伤害。未成形魔法的使用和魔法的内部使用，如闪烁魔法或驱散附魔，不受影响。法力风暴时不能使用魔术阵或魔法中心。当法力风暴来临时，所有的能量消耗减半，法力的上限减少将会被移除。</TM_ManaStorm.letterText>
  <!--EN: A psychic pulse enrages nearby predators... and nudges them towards aggressive humans.-->
  <TargetedPredatorInsanity.description>灵能的波动激怒了附近的捕食者。。。他们会攻击人类。</TargetedPredatorInsanity.description>
  <!--EN: The predator pulse fades.-->
  <TargetedPredatorInsanity.endMessage>捕食者脉冲消失了。</TargetedPredatorInsanity.endMessage>
  <!--EN: predator insanity-->
  <TargetedPredatorInsanity.label>捕食者脉冲</TargetedPredatorInsanity.label>
  <!--EN: You have enraged all nearby predators and focused them on your enemies. Be warned, the enraged animals will continue to hunt even after your enemies are gone.-->
  <TargetedPredatorInsanity.letterText>你激怒了附近所有的捕食者，并把他们的目标集中在你的敌人身上。请注意，愤怒的动物将继续狩猎，即使在你的敌人离开。</TargetedPredatorInsanity.letterText>
  <!--EN: An ancient lich has wandered into the area and is preparing to assault your colony.\n\nLichs are powerful creatures by themselves, but their true strength resides in their ability to create animated undead from the corpses of the deceased.\n\nThis lich is an ancient being that despises all life, and your merry band of living -things- has so far resisted being snuffed out. It will actively seek to end your story of survival by creating a horde of undead to overwhelm your defenses.\n\nThe lich will periodically create new skeleton warriors to attack the colony; allowing the lich to complete a ritual near an exposed corpse will increase the chance skeleton giants are created. Ultimately, the lich will assault the colony itself, if waves of undead are unable to complete the task first.-->
  <WanderingLich.description>一位古老的巫妖已经游荡到这个地区并且准备攻击你的殖民地。巫妖本身是强大的生物，但是他们真正的力量在于他们能够从尸体中创造出能活动的不死生物。这个巫妖是一个蔑视所有生命的古老亡灵，而你的快乐的殖民地，至今还拒绝被杀死。它将通过创建一大群不死族来打破你的防御，它十分乐意击败你的殖民地。巫妖将定期创建新的骷髅战士来攻击殖民地；巫妖会在露天的尸体附近完成一个仪式将会召唤一种十分强大的骷髅。最终，巫妖将攻击殖民地本身，如果不死族的浪潮无法完成任务。巫妖会结束进攻。</WanderingLich.description>
  <!--EN: The lich's assault is coming to an end.-->
  <WanderingLich.endMessage>巫妖的进攻结束了。</WanderingLich.endMessage>
  <!--EN: Wandering lich-->
  <WanderingLich.label>游荡的巫妖</WanderingLich.label>
  <!--EN: Wandering lich-->
  <WanderingLich.label>游荡的巫妖</WanderingLich.label>
  <!--EN: Wandering lich-->
  <WanderingLich.letterLabel>巫妖的进攻开始了。</WanderingLich.letterLabel>
